# color_filters.png, rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with
# Impeller, against fl-engine's frame through emblema, both at DPR 2.
# Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any channel, and by more than 32.
#
# Every filter kind on a shape's paint, an image, text and saveLayer, and as
# a layer. What differs by more than 32 is glyph edges, as in text.png. What
# differs by less is everywhere a gradient is, where the two dither apart,
# and the advanced modes' arithmetic, a few levels. Filters not affine in
# color are drawn over a solid square: Impeller filters a gradient's stops
# and emblema its pixels (docs/wonderous.md). Measured 2026-11-20, lavapipe,
# emblema with its color filter before coverage (jwinarske/emblema#275):
# 16.045% differ, 0.110% by more than 32.
differ 18.0
differ_over_32 0.2
